---
manual: element.code
lines: [1949, 1950]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @p = para "Plain, then ", code("fragment")
end
----------- test code
fragment = para("@p").contents.last

assert_instance_of Shoes::Code, fragment, "code returns a Shoes::Code"
assert_equal "fragment", fragment.text, "holding the text it was given"
assert_equal "Plain, then fragment", para("@p").text, "as a fragment inside the text block"
